# ${name}

A Space Engineers 2 mod, built with se2-modkit.

## Layout

- `${vrgproj}`, `Assets/`: the mod project. Definitions (`.def`, `.partialdef`) go in `Assets/`.
- `Source/Model/${pkg}/`: model source. `catalog.py` lists the blocks, `hooks.py` holds the tables the pipeline reads.
- `Source/Model/${build_script}.py`: builds the models (`se2mod blender run Source/Model/${build_script}.py`).
- `Tests/`: offline tests.

## Build and test

```bash
pip install "${modkit_pin}"
python -m pytest
se2mod build ${name_shell}
```

Renders go to `preview/` folders, which git ignores.

